    "Parked control freezes LINK, ordinary publication/RETURN and both generic progress/removal and ACK removal paths. Actual duplicate, fresh concurrent LINK and publication/removal refusal checks preserve owner state.",
    "Control-specific restore returns BUSY to PENDING only on same identity/epoch/owner. Conflict cannot mutate a replacement owner; original claim/capsule/module pins are deliberately retained via forget after dropping table guard. Exact phase mismatch quarantines current original entry; backend parked response is quarantined/retained. Both phase and epoch injected conflicts retain original strong owners and response through actual close_worker."
